<title>SPAIN: Hamburgische LB GZ issues 10 bln 3-year Matador.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische LB GZ issues 10 bln 3-year Matador.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hamburgische Landesbank Girozentrale is issuing a 10 billion peseta three-year matador, with a 5.65 percent coupon at price of 101.24, joint-lead manager Banco de Negocios Argentaria said.</p>
<p>The other joint-lead manager and book runner is Banco Bilbao Vizcaya.  </p>
<p>The pay date is May 23, 1997, while maturity is May 23, 2000. Ibca rating stands at AAA.</p>
<p>Full fees 1.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
